<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50/70 border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight uppercase">
        ABOUT US
      </h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-amber-500 mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Picture -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white">
          <img 
            src="/images/about-team.jpg" 
            alt="AKS Property Checklist Team" 
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover transform transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105"
            width="750"
            height="500"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400">Headquartered in Coimbatore</p>
            <p class="text-xl font-bold">Serving Clients Pan Tamil Nadu</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6 text-slate-700">

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <strong class="text-slate-900">AKS Property Checklist (AKSPCL)</strong> brings over 12 years of specialized expertise in property legal due diligence, offering systematic solutions to safeguard your real estate investments. Founded by <strong class="text-slate-900">A.K. Saravanan (M.E. Energy, LLB [Advocate])</strong>, our firm bridges technical precision with legal acumen. Drawing from his diverse background across the manufacturing, textile, education, and industrial sectors, Mr. Saravanan has engineered a rigorous, process-driven framework designed to expertly identify and resolve complex property issues.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Every service we deliver is meticulously structured, highly informative, and built to empower clients with absolute clarity regarding their property titles and records. Driven by a core mission to <strong class="text-amber-700 font-semibold">educate 1 million property owners</strong>, AKSPCL is dedicated to demystifying property documentation and maintenance to ensure completely secure, transparent, and peaceful ownership.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <a 
            href="https://forms.gle/mT9ZcDYSV3GgiWAL6" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all"
          >
            Get in Touch With Us
          </a>
          <a 
            href="#services" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl transition-all"
          >
            View Our Services
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

